				"In a stark, minimalist studio bathed in high-contrast backlighting, a skeletal cybernetic warrior stands poised against an expansive white wall, its exposed ribcage glowing faintly under ambient neon, while mechanical limbs twitch subtly; suddenly, the scene fractures—a boxer emerges silhouetted at the edge of frame, bare-chested and wrapped fists ready, sprinting forward with explosive momentum toward the skeleton, his boots kicking up fine grit on the matte floor beneath him as he lunges low, shoulder blades slicing across the air like razor-edged wings, the camera rockets past him in a whip pan that catches glints off metallic joints and recoils behind him mid-punch, revealing the silhouette's sharp angles and muscle-taut core before cutting back to wide-angle tracking shot as he crashes into the cyborg’s chestplate—the impact sends sparks flying upward in slow-motion arcs illuminated by sudden flashlights mounted above, casting fractured shadows over their entangled forms as debris swirls around them, then cuts abruptly to black screen after three heartbeats, leaving only the echo of wind rushing between their bodies."
